ocfs2_remove_from_cache(INODE_CACHE(main_bm_inode), group_bh);
Reason:
The fix moves the `ocfs2_set_new_buffer_uptodate()` call to after the validation, ensuring that only a valid group descriptor is added to the metadata cache. It also changes the cache context to `INODE_CACHE(main_bm_inode)`, which is the correct inode for the global bitmap group descriptor. The cleanup path is updated accordingly to remove the buffer from the same cache when needed, maintaining consistency. The change also adjusts the error labels to keep the validation failure path separate from the later cleanup, so the buffer is only removed from the cache after it has been successfully inserted.

